{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47271","headline":"游仙二十四首 八 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将过太帝宫，蹔诣扶桑处。\n真童已相迓，爲我清宿雾。\n海若宁洪涛，羲和止奔驭。\n五云结层阁，八景动飞舆。\n青霞正可挹，丹椹时一遇。\n留我宴玉堂，归轩不令遽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}